---
title: Layer cake
servings: 8
---
> A family recipe.
> Best made the day before.

== Sponge ==

Beat @eggs{4} and @sugar{200%g} until pale.
Fold in @flour{200%g}.

Bake in #cake tin{2} for ~{25%minutes}.

== Filling ==
Whip @cream{400%ml} with @vanilla{1%tsp}.

> Keep the cream cold.

=

Stack the layers with the filling between them.
